    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1137">

                <pb facs="1217" n="1121" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1121"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Finch to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-10"><hi rendition="#italic">February 10,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The following is a correct copy of a
                    cablegram sent you this afternoon: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                        <p>Chambers dissolved. Provisional government proclaimed. Cuestas President.
                            Quiet.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Finch.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>The following circular<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1137-f1"/> was distributed in all
                    parts of the city during the afternoon, but the people remained unexpectedly
                    quiet and only a few stores closed their doors.</p>
                <p>Your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. R. Finch.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
